He had to calmly analyse what reasons led to the debacle.
At the time trial World Cup in October in Qatar, Martin actually wanted to compete for the title.
“I’m going to take a close look at everything we’ve changed lately.”
"This includes my position," wrote the three-time time-trial world champion, who had lost more than three minutes to Olympic champion Fabian Cancellara (Switzruss) on the 54.5 km on Wednesday.
